{
  "id": "c03_lira_response",
  "text": "Lira waits. She's told you something real — the particular texture of it, the things she left out deliberately, the things she didn't bother denying. You have a moment before the garden fills up.",
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "c03_choice_a",
      "text": "\"Tell me who's arriving.\"",
